      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me write a formal letter to my landlord in berlin? the heater in my living room radiator is broken and it's getting really cold. i need to tell the hausverwaltung they need to fix it ASAP. it should sound professional and serious so they actually take it seriously.",
