      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Subject: Urgent Repair Required for Living Room Radiator\n\nDear Hoheitsvter [Landlord’s Name],\n\nI hope this message finds you well. I am writing to inform you about an issue with the radiator in my living room. Unfortunately, the heater has stopped functioning, and due to the cold season, air-conditioning has become essential for my comfort. As a dedicated tenant, I kindly request that you arrange for a prompt repair of this appliance.\n\nPlease let me know when we can expect this maintenance to commence. I rely greatly on a comfortably heated living space during these cold months. Thank you in advance for your swift attention to this matter.\n\nKind regards,  \n[Your Full Name]  \n[Your Apartment]  \n[Date]",
